<title>BRAZIL: Telerj Jan-April net 41.137 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Telerj Jan-April net 41.137 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state telecoms firm Telerj, a unit of federal giant Telebras, released the following preliminary financial results for the January-April period.</p>
<p>		  Jan-April 1997     Jan-April 1996</p>
<p> Net		41.137 million	   N/A</p>
<p> Net Revs	450.04 million	    N/A</p>
<p> Gross Revs    589.66 million	    N/A</p>
<p> Oper Profit    53.861 million	   N/A</p>
<p> Pre-Tax Profit 52.051 million	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in Brazilian reais, not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company also said Telerj's net worth reached 2.623 billion reais in the January-April period.</p>
<p>It said fixed lines installed reached 1.873 million, while new cellular terminals in service reached 168,000 in the period.</p>
<p>((-- James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485413))</p>
